  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudanaid Core Costs and National Capacity Building programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim is to strengthen the National Caritas of Sudan (Sudanaid) and its Diocesan branches with the aim of offering better services and support to the most vulnerable people in the Sudanese Society. 
The project is divided in two major components:
a)	Support the coordinating role of the National Office of Sudanaid 
b)	Support the implementing role of the Diocesan Offices of Sudanaid</narrative>
  </description>
